{"id":"xbox-360-arcade-stick","name":"Xbox 360 Arcade Stick","vendor":"Microsoft","vid":"0x045E","pid":"0x028E","productString":"Arcade Stick (XBOX 360 For Windows)","manufacturerString":"©Microsoft Corporation","type":"arcadestick","connection":"usb","xinput":{"via":"xusbCompanion","subType":"arcadeStick"},"descriptor":"05010905a10105091901290a950a7501810275069501810305010939150125083500463b10660e00750495018142750495018103750895018103c0","nativeDescriptor":"05010905a10105091901290a950a7501810275069501810305010939150125083500463b10660e00750495018142750495018103750895018103c0","inputReportSize":4,"notes":"59-byte descriptor. Source: DJm00n/ControllersInfo xusb_arcadestick. Real arcade stick subtype: 10 buttons, hat, no axes. Routes through hidmaestro_xusb.inf XUSB companion (matches xbox-360-wired path). No xinputhid driver mode (would force 16-button gamepad layout, breaking subtype fidelity). The XInput subtype is 0x03 and the HID product string Arcade Stick (XBOX 360 For Windows), the name Windows' xusb22 gives the HID device of a pad of that subtype (measured with xusb22 10.0.28000.3365).","deviceDescription":"Xbox 360 Controller for Windows","joystickName":"Arcade Stick (XBOX 360 For Windows)","replacesJoystickNames":["Xbox 360 Controller for Windows"],"triggerMode":"combined","layout":{"kind":"arcade_stick","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Xbox_360_controller","joystick":{"encoding":"hat","hatAxis":"Hat","hatPositions":8},"faceButtons":[{"role":"face_a","buttonIndex":0},{"role":"face_b","buttonIndex":1},{"role":"face_x","buttonIndex":2},{"role":"face_y","buttonIndex":3},{"role":"left_bumper","buttonIndex":4},{"role":"right_bumper","buttonIndex":5}],"systemButtons":[{"role":"back","buttonIndex":6},{"role":"start","buttonIndex":7}]}}
